# Custom Ink

> Custom Ink is the online leader in custom apparel and promotional products for groups, organizations, and businesses. We provide an end-to-end experience: design tools, expert review, and reliable fulfillment with fast & free shipping and no hidden fees. Our core promise is helping organizers look great, deliver on time, and bring their groups together.

Custom Ink serves organizers of all kinds: **professional buyers** (corporate teams, nonprofits, schools, and businesses ordering for brand, culture, or resale), **group organizers** (sports teams, clubs, schools, and community groups ordering for shared identity - including a large base of K-12 buyers like PTAs, booster clubs, and student organizations), and **occasional buyers** (individuals and small groups ordering for one-time events like birthdays, bachelorette parties, family reunions, and 5Ks).

What sets Custom Ink apart is the combination of breadth and support. With over 10,000 customizable products spanning apparel and promotional goods, there's a right solution for every group size, budget, and occasion. Intuitive design tools and a collaborative ordering process make creation fast and frictionless - and behind every order is a team of experts who review designs, back purchases with reliable guarantees, and ensure organizers can deliver with confidence. All-inclusive pricing, free design review, and fast & free shipping mean no surprises from first click to delivery.

